---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Juniors
section: join
eyebrow: Juniors / Explorer Post
heading: Juniors, ages 14 to 17
lead: Real training, with real members, starting in high school.
description: "The Bethany Fire Juniors program (Explorer Post) for ages 14 to 17: train alongside members on Tuesdays and build a path to EMR or EMT certification."
---
{% from "partials/forms.njk" import form, field, select, textarea, check %}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container split split--wide-left">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">The Juniors program is our Explorer Post for ages 14 to 17. Juniors train alongside our members on Tuesdays.</p>
      <h2>Where it can lead</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Juniors can attend the State Fire Academy in Windsor Locks.</li>
        <li>The path leads to EMR or EMT certification.</li>
        <li>At 18, Juniors can move to an accelerated application to join as full members.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <aside class="callout callout--red">
      <h3>Parents: come with them</h3>
      <p>Come to Headquarters, {{ site.address.street }}, any Tuesday at 7pm and see for yourself.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--deep" id="interest">
  <div class="container split">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">For parents and guardians</p>
      <h2>Questions parents ask</h2>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>Who is Juniors for?</summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Young people ages 14 to 17.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>When does it meet?</summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Juniors train alongside members on Tuesdays at Headquarters.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>What does it lead to?</summary><div class="faq__a"><p>It leads to EMR or EMT certification, and to an accelerated application at 18.</p></div></details>
        <details><summary>I have another question.</summary><div class="faq__a"><p>Use the form and we'll get back to you, or call <a href="tel:{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.</p></div></details>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      {% call form("juniors", forms, site.phone, "Send", "Parent or guardian interest form") %}
        <p class="small muted">Parents and guardians send this form, not minors. We only ask for the age of your child.</p>
        <div class="field-row">{{ field("parent_name", "Parent or guardian name", "text", true, "", "name") }}{{ field("email", "Email", "email", true, "", "email") }}</div>
        <div class="field-row">{{ field("phone", "Phone (optional)", "tel", false, "", "tel") }}{{ field("child_age", "Your child's age", "number", true, "Between 14 and 17") }}</div>
        {{ textarea("message", "Anything you'd like us to know? (optional)") }}
        {{ check("guardian", "I am the parent or legal guardian.", true) }}
      {% endcall %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
